Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Raises the Windows GPU timeout from 2 seconds to 60.
; An RX 590 training step is often longer than 2 seconds, and TDR then
; kills the run with no Python traceback. Reboot after importing.
; Back this key up first if you share the PC with latency-sensitive games.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\GraphicsDrivers]
"TdrDelay"=dword:0000003c
"TdrDdiDelay"=dword:0000003c
